eference]"/></label></div><label class="block text-sm" for="message"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Message</span><textarea class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3.5 py-2.5 text-base text-foreground transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary sm:text-sm min-h-28" id="message" name="contact[body]" placeholder="How can we help?" required="" rows="6"></textarea></label></fieldset><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><button class="btn-accent min-h-11 w-full sm:w-auto sm:min-w-[11rem] disabled:opacity-60" type="submit">Send message</button><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Prefer a quick call? <a class="font-medium text-gold hover:text-gold-dark" href="tel:+442080504849">020 8050 4849</a></p></div>{% endform %}</section><aside class="space-y-8 lg:col-span-2"><div><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Visit us</h2><p class="mt-3 flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" /> <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg><span>Unit 2 Old Forge Road, Wimborne, Dorset, BH21 7RR<br/><a class="mt-2 inline-block font-medium text-gold hover:text-gold-dark" href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=50.802&amp;mlon=-1.983#map=16/50.802/-1.983" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open in maps</a></span></p><div class="mt-5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border"><iframe class="h-56 w-full" loading="lazy" referrerPolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-1.995%2C50.795%2C-1.970%2C50.810&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=50.802%2C-1.983" title="Map showing Bentech Medical Ltd, Wimborne"></iframe></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Visits by appointment — <a href="/pages/demo" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-dark">book a demo</a> or message us first.</p></div><div class="space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-8"><p class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" /> <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" /></svg><span>Official UK distributor support for XSTO — warranty and parts handled locally by Bentech Medical Limited.</span></p><p class="flex gap-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3" /> <path d="M16 2v3" /> <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" /> <path d="M3 9h18" /> <path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4" /></svg><span>Need a hands-on session? <a href="/pages/demo" class="font-medium text-gold hover:text-gold-dark">Request a demo</a> in Dorset or London.</span></p></div></aside></div><section aria-labelledby="contact-faq-heading" class="mt-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"><div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl" id="contact-faq-heading">Contact FAQs</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">Quick answers before you get in touch.</p></div><a href="/pages/faq" class="text-sm font-medium text-gold hover:text-gold-dark">View all FAQs</a></div><div class="mt-8"><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-xl border border-border"><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How quickly will you reply?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We aim to respond to phone, email and form enquiries within one business day during Monday–Friday, 9:00am–5:30pm (UK time). Urgent order or warranty issues are prioritised.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Should I call, email or use the form?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Use the form for a written record (include your order reference if you have one). Call for time-sensitive delivery or warranty questions. Email works well for documents, photos or serial numbers.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I visit your Wimborne office?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes — by appointment. Book a demo or contact us first so we can arrange the right chair and a suitable time. We are at Unit 2 Old Forge Road, Wimborne, Dorset BH21 7RR.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Who do I contact about VAT relief?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Declare eligibility on the product page or in your cart — VAT is removed at checkout. For eligibility questions, see our VAT relief page or mention VAT relief in your message and we will guide you.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How do I track an order or request a return?<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Signed-in customers can view orders under Account. For tracking help, returns or damage in transit, contact us with your order reference — or start from our returns policy page.</p></details></div></div></section></div>
